{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"Introduction","y":0.058139534751301958,"w":0.11522633870442711,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.80658436138572143},{"x":0.086297956581193866,"y":0.10324567488350123,"h":0.018904532083212522,"c":1,"w":0.32534553527832027,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?"},{"x":0.082247327575019347,"y":0.14120620114945581,"c":1,"h":0.017669038581623497,"w":0.83755925496419281,"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language"},{"h":0.018248825387763734,"w":0.80461430867513006,"c":1,"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,","x":0.084308690064347894,"y":0.15919317279706158},{"c":1,"w":0.81081242879231785,"y":0.17721605604994772,"h":0.019177559267365418,"x":0.084314812445662232,"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All"},{"y":0.19347508980532957,"h":0.018770814924835455,"t":"scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,","x":0.084325857587869285,"w":0.83959874471028662,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","w":0.77791936238606774,"x":0.084292155186795975,"h":0.019053447934567425,"y":0.21227384040774755},{"y":0.22950880727656298,"w":0.83349985758463541,"c":1,"x":0.084270246663827875,"h":0.01960049192251101,"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English language ability of a candidate classified at"},{"x":0.082192059475758389,"c":1,"w":0.6669072469075521,"y":0.246804463961247,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","h":0.019631676735670234},{"x":0.082304517555460852,"t":"9 Expert User - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate and","y":0.2965116277477956,"w":0.83744857788085936,"h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1},{"w":0.32510286966959628,"h":0.014570836043610536,"y":0.31537102454710886,"x":0.11111111649484566,"c":1,"t":"fluent with complete understanding."},{"t":"8 Very Good User - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","x":0.084300583172389351,"y":0.34406844344797172,"w":0.8211119588216147,"h":0.018516100197152996,"c":1},{"h":0.020412422602533287,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in","w":0.72860977172851571,"y":0.36182742366244247,"c":1,"x":0.11099674989637245},{"c":1,"x":0.11111111967311767,"y":0.38074204921403432,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","w":0.61111109415690101,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.020433689876776628,"c":1,"x":0.082257804678405655,"t":"7 Good User - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","w":0.76144821166992194,"y":0.41105406454128957},{"y":0.43021201410572329,"w":0.75102879842122394,"h":0.017462404653237007,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","x":0.10905350191992889,"c":1},{"x":0.11101041003225395,"h":0.019583545949911185,"y":0.44638942310302054,"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.","c":1,"w":0.621575673421224},{"h":0.019448101731155409,"x":0.082242201929278835,"y":0.47787852711533496,"c":1,"w":0.78409093221028625,"t":"6 Competent User - Has generally effective command of the language despite some"},{"h":0.017479524735988794,"y":0.49705535913882981,"c":1,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","x":0.10905349095072703,"w":0.76748972574869789},{"c":1,"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","x":0.1111111157205138,"y":0.51590106019696547,"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.4691357930501302},{"t":"5 Modest User - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning in","y":0.54499443149784399,"h":0.020745672803323956,"x":0.084270228340172171,"c":1,"w":0.79648198445638019},{"y":0.56242496602702352,"t":"most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle basic","x":0.10894909442853722,"w":0.79650202433268236,"h":0.020114662790467031,"c":1},{"w":0.25308642069498699,"y":0.5827444052230577,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"communication in own field.","c":1,"x":0.11111111061141477},{"h":0.015991796172268979,"t":"4 Limited User - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent problems","x":0.080246913506393291,"y":0.61336866908483179,"c":1,"w":0.83333333333333326},{"h":0.016041444524578563,"t":"in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","w":0.6440328979492187,"c":1,"x":0.10905350976319425,"y":0.63221436956936317},{"t":"3 Extremely Limited User - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very","h":0.019320334085165647,"c":1,"y":0.66119556256761558,"x":0.080189417095401908,"w":0.7861239115397135},{"w":0.59688201904296867,"y":0.6784335548709024,"c":1,"x":0.10691059453506176,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","h":0.020057765839377906},{"t":"2 Intermittent User - No real communication is possible except for the most basic","y":0.71220930217842893,"w":0.75925923665364581,"h":0.016000356213644928,"c":1,"x":0.082304538006599828},{"x":0.10896732482356271,"h":0.018942766672590428,"c":1,"t":"information using isolated words or short formulae in familiar situations and to meet","w":0.75532292683919278,"y":0.72866637502136722},{"w":0.72852691650390622,"x":0.10897835211218232,"t":"immediate needs. Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","y":0.74687850539249678,"h":0.019140453585747119,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.83539093017578125,"t":"1 Non User - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few isolated","h":0.018909044344377457,"x":0.080246926681656519,"y":0.77761627922542154},{"w":0.063979015350341797,"x":0.10895699443551278,"y":0.79920443936484609,"c":1,"t":"words.","h":0.014963214052018392},{"y":0.82676810433557857,"t":"0 Did not attempt the test- No assessable information provided.","x":0.080126005114266596,"w":0.61340652465820322,"h":0.021951157577748237,"c":1},{"t":"7","w":0.012345678806304994,"c":1,"x":0.9074074074281232,"y":0.9302325578911671,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.016890428091527743,"x":0.39479443166124267,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96727499165316022,"w":0.2083662668863932,"c":1}]}